[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    181[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Negative node_count: C compares two ints, so `node_count >= MAX_NODES` is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    182[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // false and the insert proceeds. A usize cast in Rust would flip the branch.
